 SG_ CamIntakeBank2Position : 16|16@1+ (0.1,-30) [-30|30] "deg" OBU
 SG_ CamExhaustBank1Position : 32|16@1+ (0.1,-30) [-30|30] "deg" OBU
 SG_ CamExhaustBank2Position : 48|16@1+ (0.1,-30) [-30|30] "deg" OBU

