 SG_ KnockLevelCylinder4 : 24|8@1+ (1,0) [0|100] "%" OBU
 SG_ KnockLevelCylinder5 : 32|8@1+ (1,0) [0|100] "%" OBU
 SG_ KnockLevelCylinder6 : 40|8@1+ (1,0) [0|100] "%" OBU
