 SG_ IgnitionKnockTrimCylinder3 : 16|8@1+ (0.2,-20) [-20|31] "deg" OBU
 SG_ IgnitionKnockTrimCylinder4 : 24|8@1+ (0.2,-20) [-20|31] "deg" OBU
 SG_ IgnitionKnockTrimCylinder5 : 32|8@1+ (0.2,-20) [-20|31] "deg" OBU
 SG_ IgnitionKnockTrimCylinder6 : 40|8@1+ (0.2,-20) [-20|31] "deg" OBU
 SG_ IgnitionKnockTrimCylinder7 : 48|8@1+ (0.2,-20) [-20|31] "deg" OBU
